水 不放量 那就没事<br/>如果银行继续拉 但是科技跳水 还放量 那就很有大事。", "lou": 342, "content_length": 149, "reply_to": 878810652, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787030903}, {"pid": 878811176, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 86, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 13:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878811035,47288722,950]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-18 13:30):[/b]<br/><br/>哥  别光说大事  应对预案给一口[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>就是现在不要买啊  你没有发呆观察这个选项吗？", "lou": 343, "content_length": 47, "reply_to": 878811035, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787031135}, {"pid": 878814072, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878813984,47288722,954]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42558099]shen132465[/uid] (2026-08-18 14:03):[/b]<br/><br/>今天会做T的赚麻了[/quote]<br/>怎么麻了？手续费都不够。", "lou": 344, "content_length": 29, "reply_to": 878813984, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787033072}, {"pid": 878815004, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 44, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "华丰很明显是被华为软件带起来的 你们看看是什么消息。", "lou": 345, "content_length": 50, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787033653}, {"pid": 878815461, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 68, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:18", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878815315,47288722,957]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=2364021]龍崎[/uid] (2026-08-18 14:17):[/b]<br/><br/>据悉提前停用机构定制款Windows10操作系统[/quote]<br/>看到了 <br/>垃圾行情里的垃圾消息  硬吃一波量化<br/>属于没事找事做 治手痒的。<br/><br/>今天买什么我都觉得是加大亏损<br/>我只看", "lou": 346, "content_length": 101, "reply_to": 878815315, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787033913}, {"pid": 878816223, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878815734,47288722,958]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67141011]zanedNGA[/uid] (2026-08-18 14:21):[/b]<br/><br/>可能是这条消息[img]./mon_202608/18/axyfQ57-265cKmT1kSak-4u.jpg[/img][/quote]<br/>嗯 很明显软件那边在发散了 国产软件。不单是华为软件。", "lou": 347, "content_length": 55, "reply_to": 878815734, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787034369}, {"pid": 878816486, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 44, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878816285,47288722,960]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=63983820]一个小小小小小号[/uid] (2026-08-18 14:26):[/b]<br/><br/>换系统也算小作文？我几年前入职就给我强制安排了国产机+国产系统，难用的一[s:ac:喷]近几年除了新人外，同事只要想换电脑也都是国产啊[/quote]<br/>事情是一直在做，这个时候放出来就和基本情况无关而已。<br/>属于没行情的时候找点量化方向吃吃。", "lou": 348, "content_length": 91, "reply_to": 878816285, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787034514}, {"pid": 878817235, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 36, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:36", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878816971,47288722,962]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=228806]archy[/uid] (2026-08-18 14:33):[/b]<br/><br/>授人以鱼不如授人以渔<br/>真心请教狼大，这么说的底层逻辑(原理)是什么呀？求教&amp;#128077;&amp;#127995;[img]./mon_202608/18/axyfQ58-k517K2iT1kShs-13i.jpg[/img][/quote]<br/>你看结果就行了  我之前分享过止跌的流程。", "lou": 349, "content_length": 43, "reply_to": 878816971, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787034962}, {"pid": 878817534, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 125, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 14:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "170到1.1以上了 接近我的第一目标位。我第一次找机会减一部分底仓。", "lou": 350, "content_length": 62, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787035140}, {"pid": 878826395, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 212, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 16:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们真是无聊。。。会被一天的波动 而且还是尾盘的缩量拉升的波动影响<br/>这个卖点我是现在才说的么<br/>这不是之前就定下来的么<br/>噢 就因为尾盘拉起来了  觉得开始反转了  所以直接推翻了之前定的策略目标？<br/>那这和你们有什么区别。<br/><br/>散户都知道要高卖低买<br/>但是不知道什么时候是高 什么时候是低<br/>所以一开始根本不敢操作，当市场震荡几次后，散户觉得抓到了高和低的位置<br/>这个时候就敢做了。<br/>结果是什么样的之前你们不是经历过了吗？", "lou": 351, "content_length": 376, "14": {"13": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787040050}, {"pid": 878879936, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 113, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "盘前我们聊一下朱雀这个<br/>我明确的问一下  他这个陆地回收是不是超了大家的预期<br/>没有网系回收  没有陆地支架<br/>纯靠发动机和自带支架垂直落地回收<br/><br/>这是不是弯道超车？<br/>我先说明我不懂这个 但是我觉得很牛X。", "lou": 352, "content_length": 179, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787099820}, {"pid": 878880201, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878880028,47288722,990]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:37):[/b]<br/><br/>意思是 商业航天冲？[s:pg:转身][/quote]<br/>我没有这个意思 我单纯聊一下这个事<br/>因为我确实不懂这行  不懂这种技术在这个方向是不是弯道超车。", "lou": 353, "content_length": 93, "reply_to": 878880028, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787099983}, {"pid": 878880447, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 20, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878880364,47288722,991]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67251377]XY无夏[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:41):[/b]<br/><br/>相当牛X，而且有效载荷还不错[/quote]<br/>嗯  是一个正常的火箭 不是那种特制化的<br/>属于能量产并且商用的型号。", "lou": 354, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 878880364, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100135}, {"pid": 878880729, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:45", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878880517,47288722,991]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60006131]JYloveYW33[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:42):[/b]<br/><br/>猎鹰9号水平，差在复用验证上[/quote]<br/>那很了不得了啊   国内复用性这个不用担心<br/>0-1很难  1-99对于我们这种堆量的过程是最小的问题了。", "lou": 355, "content_length": 90, "reply_to": 878880517, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100311}, {"pid": 878880986, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 17, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878880713,47288722,991]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=11600625]红烧包子[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:44):[/b]<br/><br/>相当可以，考虑两者参数差不多的情况下，回收姿态这么稳定，我觉得真牛逼，但弯道超车倒算不上吧，只能说差距显著减少[/quote]<br/>我这么思考不懂对不对 <br/>我们本来落后100年 属于是不同时代的 就像欧洲工业革命的时候我们还在封建王朝一样<br/>现在突然只落后20年了 <br/>而且是同一水平区间的20年<br/>那我觉得这个就是弯道超车<br/>就和我们BYD刚出电车一样。", "lou": 356, "content_length": 193, "reply_to": 878880713, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100471}, {"pid": 878881441, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:52", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878881194,47288722,992]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=799113]苍炎之星[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:49):[/b]<br/><br/>朱雀三比猎鹰九先进，但考虑时间晚以及星舰的进度不能算弯道超车，而且航天圈子里对朱雀这发的判断普遍都是乐观的，成功应该算符合预期。然后从更早的计划来说民营这几家的进度其实是已经拖了后腿了，如果按本来的规化去年就该成功今年该大干快上铺星链了。[/quote]<br/>乐观预期和实际还是有误差的 特别是0-1的阶段<br/>如果能完全按预期出现0-1  他就不是真正的0-1<br/>但是这个陆地回收确实实实在在震撼了我这个老古董了。", "lou": 357, "content_length": 136, "reply_to": 878881194, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100720}, {"pid": 878881620, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878881171,47288722,992]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66997442]CyberFluxMaster[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:49):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，锤哥说商航不让炒，你有相关消息吗？[/quote]<br/>因为怕回收不成功吧<br/>毕竟之前几次都不太好<br/>虽然大家每次都乐观预期能成  但是毕竟是0-1阶段  经历过前几次太过乐观结果实际失败的报道后上面也会谨慎的<br/>但是这次是成功了啊  是真的 不参杂水分的成功啊。。。", "lou": 358, "content_length": 188, "reply_to": 878881171, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100827}, {"pid": 878881891, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 48, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878881708,47288722,993]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:54):[/b]<br/><br/>普通水平，没什么好吹的[/quote]<br/>全蓝星唯二啊。。。。这都不值得吹吗？<br/>我们已经自大到这种地步了？", "lou": 359, "content_length": 67, "reply_to": 878881708, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787100974}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 24948, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1787283392, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "はんしゅいみん", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1787283410, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1787282907, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authori